<p>Conjures up a bolt of lightning, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">57, 77, 92, 105, 117</acronym> to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">172, 231, 277, 316, 351</acronym> damage (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">114, 154, 185, 211, 234</acronym> average) and dazing the target for 3 turns.</p><p>If the target resists the daze effect it is instead shocked, which halves stun/daze/pin resistance, for 5 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>